msgstr "La comanda s'ha cancel·lat. Si necessiteu ajuda per fer la comanda, no dubteu a contactar amb nosaltres."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid ""
"Your order has been successfully paid. Your application will be published "
